---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Other Groups LC - MycoLab">
  <div class="page-container">
    <h1 class="page-title">🧫 OTHER FUNGAL GROUPS - LIQUID CULTURES</h1>
    
    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Ascomycetes</h2>
      <p>Including Morchella (morels), Tuber (truffles), and various fermentation fungi used in traditional food production.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Zygomycetes</h2>
      <p>Tempeh production (Rhizopus) and other food fermentation applications.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Key Differences</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Culture Requirements:</strong> Different nutrient preferences</li>
        <li><strong>Growth Patterns:</strong> Unique mycelial morphology</li>
        <li><strong>Applications:</strong> Food, medicine, bioremediation</li>
        <li><strong>Protocols:</strong> Specialized cultivation techniques</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
